# Claude MAIN repository
#
# What belongs here: the thinking. Markdown, notes, drafts, structure.
# What stays out: heavy media and archived source material. Those live on
# whichever machine they live on and get moved deliberately, not synced.
#
# Rule of thumb: if git would store a new copy of a 50 MB file every time it
# changed, keep it out.

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Heavy media
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.wav
*.aiff
*.m4a

# Large presentation and image assets
*.pptx
*.potx
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch

# Archived source material. 184 docx, 40 pdf and a 52 MB deck of reference
# documents that never change. Keep them on disk, out of history.
Claude Book/Legacy sources/

# Temp and lock files
*.tmp
*~
*#
.~lock.*
